  <Document>
    <name>Major Rare Earth Element Deposits – Global Polygons (Approximate)</name>
    <description>
      Approximate polygon envelopes for major REE deposits containing La, Ce, Nd, Pr.
      Polygons are conceptual only, not legal or engineering boundaries.
    </description>

    <!-- Helper: each polygon is a small rectangle around an approximate centre -->

